Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:03.48,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz10\pos(312,190)\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&HA6FDF8&\fad(1021,1)}POPURI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:03.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,As all of you are already aware,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:07.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,this upcoming November 1st \Nis Tani-kun's birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:07.99,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTrebuchet MS\bord2\c&HC94F31&}BOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.86,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? It's Tani's birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.07,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I was not aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:14.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What should I surprise him with? \NOh, I just don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:16.50,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,And don't stand around yakking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:20.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Has Tani-kun acted like he wanted \Nanything in particular lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.67,0:00:21.79,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I have no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:23.75,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You should ask him that stuff yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:26.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yamada Man, have you \Never gotten any surprises
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:29.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,that made you happy \Nor made a big impression?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:33.76,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh... Hm, I'm sure there were.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:37.77,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,What good is it asking Yamada? \NThey're totally different!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:39.64,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Like an album or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:44.15,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,He's got experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:45.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:48.32,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I don't know anything \Nabout Yamada's love life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.40,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,but I feel a huge gap \Nbetween us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:51.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Taira, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:52.91,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:55.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,How about you? How about you? \NHow about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:01:04.21,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,For that kind of thing... I don't think \Nit's about the gift being right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:07.59,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's that someone \Nremembered your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:10.55,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Them wanting to celebrate \Nmakes you happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:13.55,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Not that I care, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:18.06,Default,Suzuki; Yamada,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:23.40,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You're so grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:31.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But I don't want him finding out \Nso I can surprise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:33.66,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You're really set on that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:36.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I mean, it's his first birthday \Nsince we started dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:41.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to make it so that Tani-kun \Ncan never go back to average birthdays...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:43.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,by giving him something \Nunforgettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:44.42,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Is that a curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:45.54,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,That's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:02:03.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,115)\fnArial}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:23.35,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs16\bord1\frz355.4\c&H9D6380&\move(499,40,504,187,1,438)}(TANI'S BIRTHDAY EVE)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:22.85,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:27.10,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, you don't have cram school \Nor library duty tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:27.73,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:30.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then we have to walk together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:31.27,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:36.24,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It's a walking-home-from-school \Nbirthday date!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:39.32,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.37,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I feel like she's going to \Nsurprise me with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.33,Italics,Tani; narration,0,0,0,,In my class in middle school...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:50.50,Flashback,girl A,0,0,0,,Hinacchi! Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:54.51,Flashback,Hinacchi,0,0,0,,What? Thank you, everyone! \NThis makes me super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:58.97,Italics,Tani; narration,0,0,0,,It was tradition for everyone to \Ncelebrate our classmates' birthdays,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:02.89,Italics,Tani; narration,0,0,0,,because it'd be sad if someone's \Nbirthday didn't get celebrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:07.52,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&H7D9A14&\c&HFFFFFF&\fs24\pos(276,100)}NOVEMBER\N1ST
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.68,0:04:06.10,Italics,Tani; narration,0,0,0,,My turn came around, too, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:07.52,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fad(147,1)\fs24\pos(117,254)}TANI'S BIRTHDAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.81,Flashback,girl A,0,0,0,,Tani-kun! Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.36,Flashback,classmates,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:12.44,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:13.52,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fad(481,1)\frz295.5\pos(241.334,77.333)\c&HC3F583&\3c&H969641&}QUIET...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:17.03,Flashback,girl A,0,0,0,,Huh? Your reaction's kinda underwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:21.03,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\pos(317.333,207.333)}*ACTUALLY GRATEFUL
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:21.03,Italics,Tani; narration,0,0,0,,I still don't know what \Nthe right response was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:21.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs18\bord\pos(197.231,154.385)\3c&HF3F1F1&}reactions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.34,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs18\bord\pos(197.231,154.385)\3c&HF3F1F1&}reactions that make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:23.38,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs18\bord\pos(197.231,154.385)\3c&HF3F1F1&}reactions that make people
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:27.76,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1112)\an1\fnArial\fs18\bord\move(197.231,154.385,197.231,284.385,670,1117)\3c&HF3F1F1&}reactions that make people happy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.76,Basic Sign,SIGN. center,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5FF8A&\3c&H87863E&\pos(271,93)\fad(517,1117)}YAY
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.21,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,This is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:31.08,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,I doubt that I can act surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:35.88,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Taira, your reactions are so funny. \NIt makes all the goofing around worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:39.63,Default,boys; adlib,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:41.72,Default,boys; adlib,0,0,0,,And better luck next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:41.72,Default,boys; adlib,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.55,Default,boy B,0,0,0,,No! Can it get any worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.64,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Ugh, I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:51.40,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Taira-kun, there's something \NI'd like to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:52.48,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:54.86,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Are reactions something you work hard at?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:57.36,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Just what do you think I am, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:04:59.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Tani! We're up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:06.20,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Oh! Was that about Suzuki's surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.10,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.97,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\move(647,236,527,236,1,267)}TAIRA'S\NBIRTHDAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:32.14,Flashback Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Whether it's raining or sunny, \Nit doesn't make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:35.98,Flashback Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,No one knows it's my birthday anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:44.99,Flashback,Sei,0,0,0,,Ayumi-chan! Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:47.41,Flashback,Ayumi,0,0,0,,What? You did all this \Nafter school just for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:50.00,Flashback,Ayumi,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:45.49,Flashback - Top,classmates; background,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you! \NHappy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:50.00,Flashback - Top,classmates; background,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, dear Ayumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:54.63,Flashback - Top,classmates; background,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:56.25,Flashback Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,That's mortifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:06:00.84,Flashback Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,For a second, I thought those guys \Nhad set up a surprise for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:02.59,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Taira.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.68,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Your face looks kinda red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:08.68,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,What is it? Did you catch a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.27,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,No. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.39,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Yeah? That's fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:17.02,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Taira, where's your umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:21.11,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,I have one, but it's not raining \Nhard enough to be worth opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:23.03,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Is that just how guys work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.53,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,That was thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:29.20,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and get back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:36.29,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,What is all this? Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:40.71,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,How unlucky can I get today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:43.05,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,And on your birthday, too, huh, Taira?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.05,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.47,0:06:49.51,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,We asked each other\Nthat in English class, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:50.56,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.56,0:06:51.97,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,We did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:56.10,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,You pronunciation of "October 10th"  \Nwas way better than it needed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.77,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,That last part was unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:01.69,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Were you hoping \Nfor an announcement at lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.24,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:05.07,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,I was joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.07,0:07:07.57,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I'll give you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.66,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,The sticker that came with \N the bread I ate at lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.95,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Huh? What's with the \N"I don't want it" face?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:17.83,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,It's just... my hands are dirty, \Nso I'll accept it from you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:19.92,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:25.80,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh! A yeti sticker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:29.09,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,That's pretty cute. \NI wouldn't expect that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:30.35,Flashback,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:31.35,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H246CF3&\pos(581.334,208.666)\fad(476,1)}YOU...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:37.69,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh! Is that the one I gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:39.98,Flashback,Azuma,0,0,0,,Taira, you're so conscientious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:55.33,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Should I stay up until midnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:57.75,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b0\move(540,67,540,238,1,478)}TANI'S NIGHTS\NEND EARLY
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:08:01.67,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,If she does try to contact me, I don't \Nwant it to seem like I ignored her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:08.43,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,No. Maybe I'm just being \Ntoo self-conscious again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:25.57,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1\fnArial\fs12\b0\pos(353.333,100.667)\frz10.85}INCOMING CALL
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:25.57,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1\fnArial\fs12\b0\frz10.85\pos(362,137.334)}SUZUKI MIYU
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.45,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:31.07,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, great! You're still awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:33.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Or did my call wake you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:34.79,Italics,Tani,0,0,0,,I was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:37.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, with that voice, \Nyou must've been sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:41.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'll hang up right after I say this,\Nso wait just a sec, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:48.34,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:53.60,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Um, I actually wanted to give you \Na more elaborate surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:58.10,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but the simple truth is that I wanted to \Nbe the first to wish you happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:01.69,Italics,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:05.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But you were asleep. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:06.86,Italics,Tani,0,0,0,,I wasn't asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:08.36,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's definitely a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.24,Italics,Tani,0,0,0,,It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.99,0:09:12.66,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,He sounds so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:16.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Okay, good night! See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:24.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.25,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:28.26,Italics,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:38.89,Basic Sign,SIGN; box,0,0,0,,{\c&H854306&\3c&HF9FECD&\pos(496,186)\fad(1,1771)}ASLEEP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.68,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\c&HA6FFC6&\3c&H8A7616&\frz31.85\pos(226,38.666)\fad(731,1771)}ZZZ...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:45.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Morning, Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.69,0:09:47.86,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H7A08E5&\fs16\pos(253,24)\fad(229,482)\an8}WOO-HOO
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:51.65,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh? Tani-kun, today's your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:52.74,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:54.95,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Felicitations! Do you want a sticker?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:56.07,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.95,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Tani, here. Gummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.70,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.333,222.667)\c&HD3720B&\fad(1,1360)}BAM
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.08,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Gummies. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.50,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Tani.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.21,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs18\c&H59E6E6&\3c&H1E2024&\bord1\frz14.87\pos(320.667,137.334)\fad(642,1)}THUNDER\NCHOCOLATE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.38,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:13.13,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Well, I have to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:16.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,He's hiding the fact that \Nhe's embarrassed. That's so Taira!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:18.64,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Tani, word is that it's your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:20.81,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,My, how old are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The same age as us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:24.65,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.11,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz10\pos(312,190)\fnTrebuchet MS\bord1\c&H77EAF7&}POPURI
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:30.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! It's on-shift Taira!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.11,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:36.95,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Don't go out of your way \Nto come here on your birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:41.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The birthday-ing \Nis far from over, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.63,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,You're buying stuff, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:52.17,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Belated good wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:56.34,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:59.97,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Taira-kun, I didn't know \Nyour birthday had already passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.97,0:11:02.14,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's not right if I'm the only one \Nwho gets a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:03.52,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:05.77,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We heard from Azu earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:08.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Honestly, Taira. Why the cold shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:10.11,Default,Suzuki; simultaneous,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:10.11,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Please take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:16.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, shall we be off, Tani-kun? \NOff to today's main event?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:17.70,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,So I'm just a warm-up act?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.17,Default,manager,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:31.17,Default,manager,0,0,0,,Taira-kun, did something nice happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.80,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:42.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ta-dah! A lighter and candles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.22,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You're very prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:49.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Whoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:53.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This might be just a little too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:59.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And now... we light them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:02.83,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, I'm looking forward to knowing \Nthe seventeen-year-old you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.42,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:15.09,Italics,Tani,0,0,0,,This actually makes me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:25.22,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(470,305)\c&HCB77F5&\bord1\blur1\fad(1,980)}SHREWDLY, HAS HER OWN PORTION
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:27.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:31.10,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Want to trade a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:31.86,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:44.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, here. Your birthday present.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.41,0:12:46.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,A scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:49.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's still a little early, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:52.67,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,If he can only wear it \Nwith his regular clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.67,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'll have fewer chances to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:59.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you wore it, it would \Nmake me super, super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:00.26,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs24\pos(98,66)\c&H5C31A7&\3c&HB4A7DC&}OVEREXCITED
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:06.22,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:16.02,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Wait. Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:19.11,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,time for a kiss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:19.03,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\pos(588,55)\fad(475,191)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:19.53,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\fad(475,191)\pos(215,55)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.03,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\fad(475,191)\pos(579,274)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:20.53,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\fad(475,191)\pos(253,219)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:21.03,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\fad(475,191)\pos(87,217)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:21.53,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\pos(588,55)\fad(475,191)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:21.53,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\fad(475,191)\pos(215,55)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:21.53,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\fad(475,191)\pos(579,274)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:21.53,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\c&H940FE3&\fs24\fad(475,191)\pos(253,219)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:23.95,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:26.45,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,This makes me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:40.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:50.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? It's not cold enough \Nto wear it yet, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:51.60,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But since you gave it to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:56.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! This weekend, let's go somewhere you \Nwant to go and do something you want to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:58.44,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What I want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:01.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We're always going where I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:04.24,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,All right. I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:06.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yay! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:12.41,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HDB12AE&\fs24\frz286.7\bord1\pos(446,98)\fad(142,184)}KISS...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:27.97,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere you want to go \Nand do something you want to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:30.72,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,What do I want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:33.56,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,The harder I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:34.23,Basic Sign,SIGN; right side,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\fad(975,1)\pos(223,214)\3c&HAE423C&\c&HFCFFA7&}WHERE\NI WANT\NTO GO
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:34.23,Basic Sign,SIGN; left side,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\fad(975,1)\pos(44,214)\3c&HAE423C&\c&HCA9DF6&}WHAT\NI WANT\NTO DO
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:36.69,Italics - Top,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,To be honest, anywhere is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.48,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs20\move(319,396,319,336,1,232)}LACKS A DESIRE TO SIGHTSEE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:42.07,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Should I just go ahead and tell her that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:43.99,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:45.86,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, want to grab one with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.99,0:14:47.24,Flashback - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then I'll put the perfect plan together \Nand show you around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:48.49,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HE727A5&\frz22.42\fad(357,1)\an8\pos(400,82)}CUTESY...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:48.49,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I have one more self-centered request.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:52.95,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Could it be that I... \Nam entirely too passive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Natural...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:04.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,History...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:06.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:10.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This might be the first time since \Nmy elementary school field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:11.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, do you come here a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:14.60,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No. I just remember liking it \Nwhen I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:16.56,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, you seem the type!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:19.56,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,That's part of it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.57,0:15:31.58,Basic Sign,SIGN; large,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&H8B2EEE&\3c&HECE4FC&\an7}MOVIE\N{\fs16\c&H8B2EEE&\3c&HECE4FC&}TIME REQUIRED:\N2 HOURS 30 MINUTES
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:23.57,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,There isn't anything good \Nplaying right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:31.58,Basic Sign,SIGN; large,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H2D68F5&\3c&HCBEDFC&}ZOO\N{\fs20}TIME REQUIRED:\N2-3 HOURS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:25.70,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,We went there before, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:31.58,Basic Sign,SIGN; large,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&HF48B3B&\3c&HFDF7CD&\an4}AQUARIUM\N{\fs16}TIME REQUIRED:\N1-2 HOURS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.95,0:15:28.53,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,That seems a little short.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:37.21,Basic Sign,SIGN; large,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&H99B20D&\3c&HDCF9C5&\an6}MUSEUM\N{\fs16}TIME REQUIRED:\N3-4 HOURS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:37.21,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,After worrying and fretting, \Nthis is the answer he arrived at!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:43.21,Basic Sign,SIGN; upper right of poster,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\bord1\c&H9FA9B9&\move(535,38,617,60)}SPECIAL\NEXHIBIT
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:43.21,Basic Sign,SIGN; large; poster,0,0,0,,{\fs24\move(371,162,455,188)}A\NWORLD\NOF\NTREASURES
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:40.09,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Want to see the special exhibit \Nwhile we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It seems pretty popular, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:46.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:52.18,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I can't see anything at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:55.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.98,0:15:57.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:15:59.94,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:01.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:06.49,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs24\an8}30\NMINUTES\NLATER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:15.54,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,All we could see were \Nthe backs of people's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:24.17,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:28.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Why? Tani-kun, you don't have \Nanything to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:32.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We still haven't seen \Nthe permanent exhibits!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:35.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's make the rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:42.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's easy to see things \Nover here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:44.65,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,The exhibition halls are really spacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.19,0:16:47.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:50.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Is Emil's butterfly here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.32,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:52.03,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HEC8513&\pos(286,239)\fad(314,979)\frz7.414}THAT WAS\NA MOTH
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:54.28,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:57.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Its legs are adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:01.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:04.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:08.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There's so much stuff to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:17.06,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's dark outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:18.81,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We got pretty far!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.81,0:17:23.31,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But we still didn't manage to get around \Nto everything. The museum is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:26.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:28.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\b0\bord0\c&HB0DB04&\frz14.81\pos(58,271)\fad(312,858)}WHEW
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:32.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm hungry after all that. Want to grab \Nsomething to eat before we go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:36.62,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,There seems to be a good \Nrestaurant nearby. Let's go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:39.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?! You researched in advance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:42.33,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\pos(321,348)\bord1\c&H35311F&\3c&HA1935E&}TEMPORARILY\NCLOSED
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:50.72,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs12\bord1\c&H35311F&\3c&HA1935E&\pos(315,176)}TEMPORARILY\NCLOSED
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:43.42,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:45.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, you had no control over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:47.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,There's another restaurant nearby, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:50.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? You really did a lot of research!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:52.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:57.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,With something like ramen, \Nthe turnover is pretty fast, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:17:59.64,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What do you want to do? Should we line up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:04.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H9CBA1E&\fs24\pos(170.667,136)}WAIT\NTIME
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:04.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H9CBA1E&\fs24\pos(174.667,250)}EATING\NTIME
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:04.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H9B4ADF&\pos(48,286)}ARRIVE\NHOME...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:03.27,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:04.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:06.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, \Nit's over our budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.23,0:18:10.24,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(318,83)\c&H2C434B&\3c&H7EAAB4&}SU
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:09.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'd love to go there when I grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.24,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Suitable foodstuffs found!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:19.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It gets chilly once the sun\N goes down, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:23.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I can feel that in my bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:29.34,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Somehow, I feel like none of \Nmy plans went right today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:34.22,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\fs16\an7\fad(1484,942)\c&H7A24E6&\bord2\3c&HEDFFA2&}I WANT TO GO OVER THERE!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:34.22,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fad(1484,942)\pos(133,203)\c&H4D8DE7&}OVER\NTHERE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:34.22,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fad(1484,942)\an4\c&HA9FFFD&\3c&HB8A776&}HMMM
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:34.22,Basic Sign,SIGN; book,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fad(1484,942)\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(61.334,352.667)}TIME\NSCHEDULE
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.71,0:18:32.55,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Actually, have I been depending \Non her too much?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.68,0:18:36.26,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, are you tired \Nfrom all that walking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:37.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:41.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But because I walked so much, \Nthis food is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:45.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's a shame that we couldn't go \Nto the restaurant that you looked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:49.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but, in its own way, \Nthis can't be beat. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:53.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We're always doing \Nthe things I want to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:57.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,so today, I wanted to do \Nsomething that you wanted to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:19:00.08,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But I'm the one who ended up \Nhaving fun again today anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:04.91,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:08.13,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,like it better when you're \Nhaving fun, Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.13,0:19:08.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:13.97,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Where we go, what we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:16.80,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,More than those places or goals...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.89,0:19:20.85,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,it's the time I spend with you, \NSuzuki-san, that I enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.81,0:19:24.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:27.10,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I totally get that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:27.90,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:28.94,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HA0B50E&\fs28\pos(129,136)\fad(1,1232)}WHAT?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:29.94,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:35.20,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I say stuff like, "I want to go there," \Nor "I want to do this,"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:39.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but it's all really "I want to go \Nto XYZ with Tani-kun," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:41.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's the same! Just the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:45.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? Um. Is it different?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:46.37,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.71,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm the same, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:53.09,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, thank you \Nfor everything you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:56.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:00.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? That's what you were thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:03.77,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I wish I could have done a better job \Nof showing you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:05.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It was all just fine, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:08.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But I appreciate that you feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:15.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You know... Today, I was all, \N"Let's continue Tani-kun's birthday bash!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:17.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,But I made it so you had to be \Nconsiderate of my feelings instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:20.49,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b0\pos(498,264)\fad(273,1)}"BASH"\NMEANING\N"HUGE\NBIRTHDAY\NPARTY"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:19.66,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Birthday bash?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:23.79,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, I was the one \Nspinning in circles for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:27.21,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,And the museum was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:28.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:31.46,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to go to that nearby \Nart museum sometime, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.00,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:36.05,Default - Top,Suzuki; simultaneous,0,0,0,,I want to see all the colorful paintings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:36.05,Default,Tani; simultaneous,0,0,0,,I have some interest \Nin European art history.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:44.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I may be slightly lacking in \Nan intellectual spirit of inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:48.35,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No, I just have \Nno artistic sense at all, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:58.82,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Well, I'll see you at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:06.33,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:33.98,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.13,0:21:57.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:01.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Squee!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:14.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Squee!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.69,0:22:16.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:18.86,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,My! You look like you had fun!
